<p>A public inquiry in the United Kingdom found that the 2024 knife attack at a Taylor Swift-themed dance class in Southport, where three girls were killed, was likely preventable if the attacker’s parents and multiple state agencies had acted on warning signs about his fixation on violence. The report describes repeated missed chances before the attack, including failures by family members and public bodies to respond in ways that might have reduced the risk. The findings matter well beyond this one case. The attack became one of the most shocking acts of violence in recent British history and later helped fuel nationwide riots in Britain.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/zPclnZmaFY2fALsnko0xX3xdpqCkuZDhLX8_t13-FjJXgjzEIlviVoGXYf3YFVBcMcRrb3nwVzfhUlYvoAQvFxpdgynUTiXlI-x_VeIwT77KSboEuC_hGd3oep5at1MRUc0aCi0ULCE6XaC5B-6i3yCAtYweDeX4lERhdLmoyx2M_7c5u-L4yTBcPSDNrw' alt='A memorial for the victims of the attack, in which three young girls were murdered and 10 others were injured, in Southport, England, in 2024.' /><br /><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/04/14/g-s1-117332/uk-report-stabbings-at-dance-class'>U.K. inquiry lays bare &#x27;catastrophic&#x27; missed chances before stabbings at dance class</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/uk-finds-attack-on-taylor-swift-themed-class-preventable/a-76767586'>UK finds attack on Taylor Swift-themed class &#x27;preventable&#x27;</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/uk-knife-attack-taylor-swift-dance-class-public-inquiry/'>Knife attack that killed 3 girls could have been prevented, U.K. inquiry finds</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/uk-report-lays-bare-catastrophic-missed-chances-stabbings-131993308'>UK report lays bare &#x27;catastrophic&#x27; missed chances before stabbings at girls&#x27; dance class</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/13/world/europe/southport-attack-killers-parents-